diesel generator',1,'2026-10-14 23:20:33','2026-10-14 23:20:33'),(576,'Standby Emergency Backup Generator UAE','d-exewmv.jpg','media/2026/10/d-exewmv.jpg','public','image/jpeg',21202,'425x283','Standby emergency backup generator for hospitals and data centers Dubai','Hospital & data center standby backup generator',1,'2026-10-14 23:20:33','2026-10-14 23:20:33'),(577,'High-Ambient Tropicalized Generator Setup','e-sajmqx.jpg','media/2026/10/e-sajmqx.jpg','public','image/jpeg',39557,'425x283','High-ambient 52C tropicalized generator rental UAE','High-ambient heavy duty radiator cooling system for 52°C UAE heat',1,'2026-10-14 23:20:33','2026-10-14 23:20:33'),(578,'Automatic Transfer Switch (ATS) & Generator Panel','ats-switch-guide.jpg','media/2026/10/blog/ats-switch-guide.jpg','public','image/jpeg',66704,'1000x667','Automatic transfer switch ATS panel with diesel generator','Motorized 4-pole automatic transfer switch ATS installation',1,'2026-10-14 23:20:33','2026-10-14 23:20:33'),(579,'Diesel Generator Fuel Efficiency & Monitoring','fuel-consumption.jpg','media/2026/10/blog/fuel-consumption.jpg','public','image/jpeg',99591,'1000x667','Diesel generator fuel consumption calculator and monitoring','Real-time telemetry and diesel fuel flow monitoring system',1,'2026-10-14 23:20:33','2026-10-14 23:20:33'),(580,'Generator Sizing & kVA Load Calculation Chart','generator-sizing-guide.jpg','media/2026/10/blog/generator-sizing-guide.jpg','public','image/jpeg',211149,'1000x662','Generator sizing guide kVA to kW formula electrical load table','Engineering guide for sizing diesel generators and inductive starting loads',1,'2026-10-14 23:20:33','2026-10-14 23:20:33'),(581,'50°C High-Ambient Desert Cooling Radiator','high-ambient-50c.jpg','media/2026/10/blog/high-ambient-50c.jpg','public','image/jpeg',39557,'425x283','50C high ambient radiator and sand filter for UAE desert operation','Desert-tropicalized cooling core and sand-trap air filtration',1,'2026-10-14 23:20:33','2026-10-14 23:20:33'),(582,'Portacabin Site Power & Distribution Wiring','portacabin-power-wiring.jpg','media/2026/10/blog/portacabin-power-wiring.jpg','public','image/jpeg',20140,'425x283','Portacabin temporary office and accommodation power supply wiring','Distribution board and power cabling for modular site cabins',1,'2026-10-14 23:20:33','2026-10-14 23:20:33'),(583,'Prime vs Standby Power Generator Comparison','prime-vs-standby.jpg','media/2026/10/blog/prime-vs-standby.jpg','public','image/jpeg',288862,'1000x1500','Prime power vs standby power rating ISO 8528 engineering comparison','Continuous, prime, and standby rating definitions under ISO 8528',1,'2026-10-14 23:20:33','2026-10-14 23:20:33');
