atordubai.com\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n                    \"position\": 2,\n                    \"name\": \"Technical Articles\",\n                    \"item\": \"https://generatordubai.com/blog\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n                    \"position\": 3,\n                    \"name\": \"How to Size a 50 kVA Diesel Generator: Single-Phase vs 3-Phase UAE Guide\",\n                    \"item\": \"https://generatordubai.com/post/size-50-kva-generator-uae\"\n                }\n            ]\n        },\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n            \"@id\": \"https://generatordubai.com/post/size-50-kva-generator-uae#faq\",\n            \"mainEntity\": [\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"What is the standard fuel consumption for a generator under 75% load in UAE?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"On average, modern prime-rated diesel generators (powered by Cummins or Perkins engines) consume approximately 0.22 to 0.25 liters of diesel per kilowatt-hour (kWh). For instance, a 250 kVA (200 kW) unit at 75% load (150 kW) burns approximately 35 to 38 liters per hour under typical UAE summer conditions.\"\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"Can a 3-phase generator run single-phase loads safely?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"Yes, but individual phase loads must be balanced carefully. The current draw on any individual phase must not exceed the rated single-phase ampacity, and phase unbalance should strictly remain within 10% to prevent excessive neutral heating and alternator rotor vibration.\"\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"How often should a continuous-running rental generator be serviced?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"For generators operating 24/7 on continuous prime duty, routine servicing\\u2014including lube oil change, oil filter, and primary/secondary fuel filter replacements\\u2014is scheduled every 250 operational hours. Air filters require weekly compressed air dusting in sandy UAE environments.\"\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"Does Generator Dubai provide 24/7 breakdown technical support?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"Yes. All rental packages include round-the-clock emergency field engineering assistance, rapid mobile technician dispatch within 60 to 90 minutes across Dubai and northern emirates, and dedicated backup equipment availability.\"\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        }\n    ]\n}'),(574,1,'Sizing Generators for Tower Cranes: Calculating DOL Motor Surge Amps','tower-crane-generator-sizing-inrush-kva','Comprehensive technical breakdown of Sizing Generators for Tower Cranes: Calculating DOL Motor Surge Amps for UAE engineering and procurement teams. Covers operational sizing, field protocols, an','<h2>Engineering Fundamentals: Sizing Generators for Tower Cranes: Calculating DOL Motor Surge Amps</h2>\n<div class=\"p-5 my-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 text-slate-800 text-sm leading-relaxed shadow-sm\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-800\">AEO Key Takeaway / Executive Summary</span>\n    <p class=\"mt-2 text-slate-7