                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"Dubai Municipality environmental regulations mandate that sound levels during night entertainment in residential vicinity must remain below 55 dB(A) at the property perimeter. We utilize super-silent acoustic enclosures engineered with secondary hospital-grade exhaust silencers.\"\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"How do you size generators for high-ambient temporary chiller rental?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"Industrial chillers feature massive screw or centrifugal compressors. We calculate total running tons of refrigeration (TR) and account for compressor soft-start inrush curves, adding a 25% thermal buffer to manage extreme 50\\u00b0C summer condenser heat rejection.\"\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"What precautions are necessary when powering submerged dewatering pumps?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"Submersible dewatering pumps run continuously in wet, conductive environments. Generators must be fitted with sensitive 30mA residual current devices (RCD) or core-balance earth fault protection, paired with IP67 weatherproof distribution sockets.\"\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        }\n    ]\n}'),(787,1,'Tunnel Construction Ventilation: Sizing High-Pressure Jet Fan Generators','tunnel-construction-ventilation-fan-generator-uae','Comprehensive technical breakdown of Tunnel Construction Ventilation: Sizing High-Pressure Jet Fan Generators for UAE engineering and procurement teams. Covers operational si