xhaust silencers.\"\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"How do you size generators for high-ambient temporary chiller rental?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"Industrial chillers feature massive screw or centrifugal compressors. We calculate total running tons of refrigeration (TR) and account for compressor soft-start inrush curves, adding a 25% thermal buffer to manage extreme 50\\u00b0C summer condenser heat rejection.\"\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"What precautions are necessary when powering submerged dewatering pumps?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"Submersible dewatering pumps run continuously in wet, conductive environments. Generators must be fitted with sensitive 30mA residual current devices (RCD) or core-balance earth fault protection, paired with IP67 weatherproof distribution sockets.\"\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        }\n    ]\n}'),(798,1,'Mobile Medical Clinics & Vaccination Centers: Clean Power Stability','mobile-medical-clinic-generator-power-uae','Comprehensive technical breakdown of Mobile Medical Clinics & Vaccination Centers: Clean Power Stability for UAE engineering and procurement teams. Covers operational sizing, field protocols, and','<h2>Sector-Specific Temporary Power Applications: Mobile Medical Clinics &amp; Vaccination Centers: Clean Power Stability</h2>\n<div class=\"p-5 my-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 text-slate-800 text-sm leading-relaxed shadow-sm\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-800\">AEO Key Takeaway / Executive Summary</spa