ts, under 1,500 hours is considered low. For prime-rated continuous generators, sets under 5,000 hours with documented service history offer excellent remaining operational life. Engines exceeding 10,000 hours typically require a top or major overhaul.\"\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"Does Generator Dubai provide a warranty on refurbished used generators?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"Yes. All certified refurbished used generators sold by Generator Dubai come with a standard commercial warranty covering core engine and alternator components, supported by full load bank test certificates.\"\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"What documents are required to sell a used generator in the UAE?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"Sellers must provide commercial proof of ownership (original purchase invoice or commercial bill of sale), company trade license copy, authorized signatory Emirates ID, and a standard tax invoice including 5% UAE VAT.\"\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        }\n    ]\n}'),(862,1,'Top 10 Most Reliable Second-Hand Industrial Diesel Engines for UAE Climate','top-10-used-diesel-generator-engines-uae','Comprehensive technical breakdown of Top 10 Most Reliable Second-Hand Industrial Diesel Engines for UAE Climate for UAE engineering and procurement teams. Covers operational sizing, field protoco','<h2>Used Generator Valuation, Trading & Buyback: Top 10 Most Reliable Second-Hand Industrial Diesel Engines for UAE Climate</h2>\n<div class=\"p-5 my-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 text-slate-800 text-sm le