 Rockwool (mineral wool) core panels deliver non-combustible Class A1 fire resistance, which is strictly mandated by UAE Civil Defense for kitchen cabins, accommodation blocks, and commercial offices.\"\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"Do I need to clean or prepare cabins before selling them for scrap?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"No. We purchase scrap portacabins on an \\\"as-is, where-is\\\" basis. Our teams handle all interior stripping, window removal, non-metallic insulation segregation, and environmental waste disposal.\"\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"What proof of site clearance is provided for municipal deposits?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"Upon completing removal, we issue a formal Certificate of Site Clearance accompanied by photographic evidence and waste disposal manifests required by Dubai Municipality or Abu Dhabi authorities to release bank guarantees.\"\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        }\n    ]\n}'),(865,1,'Scrap Portacabin Buyer in UAE: Instant Cash Valuation & Site Clearance','scrap-portacabin-buyer-instant-cash-uae','Comprehensive technical breakdown of Scrap Portacabin Buyer in UAE: Instant Cash Valuation & Site Clearance for UAE engineering and procurement teams. Covers operational sizing, field protocols, ','<h2>Portacabin Trading, Refurbishment & Scrap Demolition: Scrap Portacabin Buyer in UAE: Instant Cash Valuation &amp; Site Clearance</h2>\n<div class=\"p-5 my-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 text-slate-800 text-sm leading-relaxed shadow-sm\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs f