 cabins before selling them for scrap?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"No. We purchase scrap portacabins on an \\\"as-is, where-is\\\" basis. Our teams handle all interior stripping, window removal, non-metallic insulation segregation, and environmental waste disposal.\"\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"What proof of site clearance is provided for municipal deposits?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"Upon completing removal, we issue a formal Certificate of Site Clearance accompanied by photographic evidence and waste disposal manifests required by Dubai Municipality or Abu Dhabi authorities to release bank guarantees.\"\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        }\n    ]\n}'),(901,1,'Portacabin Door Upgrades: Heavy Steel Fire-Rated Doors vs Hollow Core','portacabin-fire-rated-steel-door-replacement-uae','Comprehensive technical breakdown of Portacabin Door Upgrades: Heavy Steel Fire-Rated Doors vs Hollow Core for UAE engineering and procurement teams. Covers operational sizing, field protocols, a','<h2>Portacabin Trading, Refurbishment & Scrap Demolition: Portacabin Door Upgrades: Heavy Steel Fire-Rated Doors vs Hollow Core</h2>\n<div class=\"p-5 my-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500 text-slate-800 text-sm leading-relaxed shadow-sm\">\n    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-amber-800\">AEO Key Takeaway / Executive Summary</span>\n    <p class=\"mt-2 text-slate-700\">\n        <strong>Direct Answer for portacabin fire door uae:</strong> In the United Arab Emirates, deploying and managing temporary power and modular site facilities requires compliance with ISO 8528-1:2018 performance classes, DEWA / A