thane (PU) provides slightly superior thermal insulation efficiency, while Rockwool (mineral wool) core panels deliver non-combustible Class A1 fire resistance, which is strictly mandated by UAE Civil Defense for kitchen cabins, accommodation blocks, and commercial offices.\"\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"Do I need to clean or prepare cabins before selling them for scrap?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"No. We purchase scrap portacabins on an \\\"as-is, where-is\\\" basis. Our teams handle all interior stripping, window removal, non-metallic insulation segregation, and environmental waste disposal.\"\n                    }\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                    \"name\": \"What proof of site clearance is provided for municipal deposits?\",\n                    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                        \"text\": \"Upon completing removal, we issue a formal Certificate of Site Clearance accompanied by photographic evidence and waste disposal manifests required by Dubai Municipality or Abu Dhabi authorities to release bank guarantees.\"\n                    }\n                }\n            ]\n        }\n    ]\n}'),(905,1,'Used Portacabin Accommodation Units with Bunk Beds for Remote Field Crews','used-labor-accommodation-bunk-portacabin-uae','Comprehensive technical breakdown of Used Portacabin Accommodation Units with Bunk Beds for Remote Field Crews for UAE engineering and procurement teams. Covers operational sizing, field protocol','<h2>Portacabin Trading, Refurbishment & Scrap Demolition: Used Portacabin Accommodation Units with Bunk Beds for Remote Field Crews</h2>\n<div class=\"p-5 my-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border-l-4 border-amber-500