             \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n                    \"position\": 3,\n                    \"name\": \"50 kVA (40 kW) Silent Diesel Generator\",\n                    \"item\": \"https://generatordubai.com/fleet/50-kva\"\n                }\n            ]\n        }\n    ]\n}'),(7,'100 kVA (80 kW) Silent Diesel Generator','100-kva','100 kVA Prime / 110 kVA Standby Soundproof Power','100 kVA Fleet','Diesel Generators','zap','The 100 kVA rental generator is our most versatile workhorse unit across Dubai and Abu Dhabi, delivering 80 kW of balanced three-phase power for construction machinery and continuous commercial standby.','<p>The 100 kVA rental generator is our most versatile workhorse unit across Dubai and Abu Dhabi, delivering 80 kW of balanced three-phase power for construction machinery and continuous commercial standby.</p><p>Featuring genuine Cummins C110 D5 / Perkins 1104A-44TAG2 engine technology, this 100 kVA set delivers high fuel efficiency, ultra-low acoustic sound levels (68 dBA @ 7m), and continuous 3-phase 400V/230V 50Hz electrical supply even under high ambient summer temperatures of 50°C+.</p>','{\"fuel_tank\": \"340 Liters (~17 hrs continuous)\", \"dimensions\": \"2750 x 1100 x 1750 mm\", \"dry_weight\": \"1,820 kg\", \"prime_power\": \"100 kVA / 80 kW\", \"engine_model\": \"Cummins C110 D5 / Perkins 1104A-44TAG2\", \"standby_power\": \"110 kVA / 88 kW\", \"circuit_breaker\": \"160A 4-Pole MCCB\", \"fuel_consumption\": \"16.5 L/hr @ 75% Load\", \"sound_attenuation\": \"68 dBA @ 7m\"}','[\"Mid-sized construction sites and building contractor headquarters\", \"Tower cranes (up to 45m jib) and multi-pump dewatering networks\", \"Cold storage warehousing and supermarket refrigeration backup\", \"Outdoor corporate events, wedding tents, and luxury hospitality venues\"]',NULL,NULL,'/storage/media/2026/10/2-im4l8z.jpg','published',2,1,'100 kva generator rental dubai','100 kVA Diesel Generator Rental Dubai & UAE | Silent Canopy','Hire 100 kVA (80 kW)