            {\n                    \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n                    \"position\": 2,\n                    \"name\": \"Services\",\n                    \"item\": \"https://generatordubai.com/services\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n                    \"position\": 3,\n                    \"name\": \"24/7 Generator Maintenance & Emergency Repair\",\n                    \"item\": \"https://generatordubai.com/service/maintenance\"\n                }\n            ]\n        }\n    ]\n}'),(20,'Used & Refurbished Portacabins | Scrap Cabin Buying UAE','portacabin','Used Portacabins Buy & Sell in Dubai, Scrap Portacabin Buyer UAE & Refurbished Site Offices','UAE Modular Equipment Hub • Buy, Sell, Scrap & Refurbished Only','building','Certified buyer & seller of used, scrap and refurbished portacabins across Dubai, Sharjah and UAE. Instant cash valuation, crane dismantling and transport. (Note: We do not offer rental portacabins).','<div class=\"space-y-8\">\n    <div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/20 text-slate-900\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-amber-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span>Specialized Used & Scrap Portacabin Solutions in UAE</span>\n        </h3>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">\n            Generator Dubai is a premier industrial equipment specialist across the United Arab Emirates. In our modular site division, <strong>we specialize exclusively in buying used portacabins, purchasing scrap portacabins for instant cash, selling certified pre-owned units, and providing premium refurbished site offices</strong>. Please note: <em>We do not offer portacabin rental services</em>. For temporary site requirements, our <strong>Guaranteed Buyback Program</strong> allows contractors to purchase refurbished cabins and sell them back upon project completion at a locked-in valuation, saving thousands compared to rental fees.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display\">1. Used Portacabin Buy in Dubai & Across UAE</h2>\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n            Have surplus project cabins after completing a construction contract? We provide immediate on-site inspections and <strong>instant cash valuation for used portacabins</strong> across Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah, Ajman, and Northern Emirates. Our heavy logistics team coordinates full crane rigging, flatbed mobilization, and site clearance within 24 to 48 hours, eliminating site handover delays and municipality penalties.\n        </p>\n        <ul class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-slate-700\">\n            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span> Instant Cash Payment Upon Agreement</li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span> Free On-Site Inspection & Technical Valuation</li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span> Heavy Crane Rigging & Flatbed Transport Included</li>\n            <li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span> Bulk Compound Decommissioning (5 to 50+ Cabins)</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display\">2. Scrap Portacabin Buy in UAE – Certified Site Demolition & Removal</h2>\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n            If your site cabins have suffered severe corrosion, water damage, roof collapse, or structural fatigue, selling them as scrap is the most cost-effective and compliant disposal route. We are a licensed <strong>scrap portacabin buyer in the UAE</strong>. We calculate scrap value based on verified structural steel weight, copper electricals, and aluminum framing while executing safe, Civil Defense compliant dismantling directly on-site.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"mt-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-sm space-y-2\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between font-semibold text-slate-900\">\n                <span>Safe Electrical De-energization:</span>\n                <span class=\"text-emerald-700\">100% Certified Handled</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between font-semibold text-slate-900\">\n                <span>Sandwich Panel Core Stripping:</span>\n                <span class=\"text-emerald-700\">Environmentally Responsible</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between font-semibold text-slate-900\">\n                <span>Freeport & Freezone Clearance:</span>\n                <span class=\"text-emerald-700\">JAFZA, KIZAD, HFZA Gate Permits</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display\">3. Used Portacabin Sell in UAE – Certified Second-Hand Site Cabins</h2>\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n            Looking for cost-effective, ready-to-deploy modular units? We stock thoroughly tested and certified <strong>used portacabins for sale in UAE</strong> at our Dubai and Sharjah depots. Every used unit undergoes a rigorous 40-point structural, waterproof, and electrical diagnostic check before dispatch.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm\">Site Offices (20ft & 40ft)</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\">Insulated sandwich panel offices with pre-wired distribution boards and AC provisions.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm\">Security Guard Houses</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\">Compact 1.5m x 1.5m to 2.4m x 2.4m guard huts with 360-degree sliding windows.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm\">Ablution & Toilet Units</h4>\n                <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1\">Multi-stall hygienic site toilets, urinals, wash basins, and water heater points.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n        <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight font-display\">4. Refurbished Portacabins in UAE & Dubai</h2>\n        <p class=\"mt-3 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">\n            Our specialized modular engineering facility reconditions damaged site cabins into showroom-grade, long-lifecycle executive units. Our refurbishment protocol replaces degraded polyurethane (PU) or rockwool sandwich panels, applies multi-layer anti-rust epoxy coatings to structural steel chassis, installs high-ambient T3 split air conditioners, and refits heavy-duty industrial vinyl or porcelain tile floors.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 text-white\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold font-display text-amber-400\">Looking to Buy, Sell, Scrap or Refurbish a Portacabin?</h3>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate-300\">\n            Contact our modular trading team today for an immediate cash offer on your surplus cabins or to inspect our refurbished inventory in Dubai and Sharjah.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-4 items-center\">\n            <a href=\"https://wa.me/971569213754?text=Hello+Generator+Dubai,+I+am+inquiring+about+Buying/Selling/Scrap+Portacabins\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs bg-amber-500 text-slate-950 hover:bg-amber-400 transition\">\n                WhatsApp Portacabin Desk: +971 56 921 3754\n            </a>\n            <a href=\"tel:+971569213754\" class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs bg-slate-800 text-white hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 transition\">\n                Direct Call: +971 56 921 3754\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 font-display pt-4\">Frequently Asked Questions: Used & Scrap Portacabins UAE</h2>\n    <div class=\"space-y-4 my-6\">\n        <details class=\"group rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 p-5 transition-all\">\n            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer list-none\">\n                <span>Do you buy scrap portacabins across all UAE Emirates?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">▼</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                Yes. We are the premier buyer of scrap and decommissioned portacabins in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah, Ajman, RAK, and Fujairah. We buy damaged, rusted, fire-affected, or end-of-life cabins in any condition with instant cash payment.\n            </div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 p-5 transition-all\">\n            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer list-none\">\n                <span>Can I sell my used site office portacabin in Dubai for instant cash?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">▼</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                Yes. If your construction project is finished and you have surplus site offices, security cabins, mess halls, or ablution units, our evaluation team provides same-day on-site inspections and immediate cash or bank transfer payment before removal.\n            </div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 p-5 transition-all\">\n            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer list-none\">\n                <span>Do you provide crane dismantling and removal for scrap portacabins?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">▼</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                Yes. We bring our own heavy hiab crane trucks, flatbeds, and certified rigging crews. We handle all unbolting, crane lifting, loading, and safe transport from your site, with zero logistical headache or expense for the seller.\n            </div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 p-5 transition-all\">\n            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer list-none\">\n                <span>What sizes and types of refurbished portacabins do you sell in UAE?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">▼</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                We supply fully refurbished, high-grade modular cabins in popular dimensions: 6m x 3m (20ft x 10ft), 9m x 3m (30ft x 10ft), and 12m x 3.6m (40ft x 12ft). Each unit is fitted with heavy-duty structural steel frames, new sandwich panel insulation, commercial vinyl flooring, LED lighting, split AC units, and complete distribution boards ready for immediate occupancy.\n            </div>\n        </details>\n    </div>','[\"Sizes available: 10ft, 20ft, and 40ft modular configurations\", \"High-density PU insulation with thermal acoustic dampening\", \"Pre-wired with copper armored cabling, circuit breakers, and LED lighting\", \"Split AC units, executive desks, and conference layouts available\", \"Turnkey sanitary plumbing with waste storage tanks\"]','[\"Instant plug-and-play connection to our rental generator fleet\", \"Fast on-site delivery with flatbed boom cranes\", \"Flexible monthly and project-duration lease terms\", \"Cash buy-back and relocation services available upon project completion\"]',NULL,'/storage/media/2026/10/06-wx9o27.jpg','published',5,1,'used portacabin buy in dubai','Used Portacabin Buy & Sell Dubai | Scrap Cabin Buyer UAE | Refurbished Cabins','Buy and sell used portacabins in Dubai & UAE. Top scrap portacabin buyer with instant cash payment, crane dismantling, and premium refurbished site offices.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://generatordubai.com/storage/media/2026/10/06-wx9o27.jpg',1,98,95,'2026-10-13 22:37:45','2026-10-14 22:10:53','{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@graph\": [\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"Service\",\n            \"@id\": \"https://generatordubai.com/service/portacabin#service\",\n            \"name\": \"Portacabin & Site Offices\",\n            \"serviceType\": \"Diesel Power Engineering & Rental\",\n            \"description\": \"Rent and buy insulated portacabins, site offices, and ablution cabins across Dubai, Sharjah and UAE with instant generator power hookup.\",\n            \"url\": \"https://generatordubai.com/service/portacabin\",\n            \"image\": \"https://generatordubai.com/storage/media/2026/10/06-wx9o27.jpg\",\n            \"provider\": {\n                \"@type\": \"HomeAndConstructionBusiness\",\n                \"@id\": \"https://generatordubai.com/#organization\",\n                \"name\": \"Generator Dubai\",\n                \"legalName\": \"Generator Dubai Temporary Power Solutions LLC\",\n                \"alternateName\": [\n                    \"Generator Rental Dubai\",\n                    \"Rental Generator UAE\"\n                ],\n                \"url\": \"https://generatordubai.com\",\n                \"logo\": \"https://generatordubai.com/images/logo-original.png\",\n                \"image\": \"https://generatordubai.com/storage/media/2026/09/1-y7ja6x.webp\",\n                \"telephone\": \"+971569213754\",\n                \"email\": \"hello@generatordubai.com\",\n                \"priceRange\": \"$$$\",\n                \"address\": {\n                    \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n                    \"streetAddress\": \"Suit 44, King Faisal Street\",\n                    \"addressLocality\": \"Sharjah\",\n                    \"addressRegion\": \"Sharjah\",\n                    \"postalCode\": \"00000\",\n                    \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"\n                },\n                \"geo\": {\n                    \"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\",\n                    \"latitude\": 25.3463,\n                    \"longitude\": 55.4209\n                },\n                \"openingHoursSpecification\": [\n                    {\n                        \"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\",\n                        \"dayOfWeek\": [\n                            \"Monday\",\n                            \"Tuesday\",\n                            \"Wednesday\",\n                            \"Thursday\",\n                            \"Friday\",\n                            \"Saturday\",\n                            \"Sunday\"\n                        ],\n                        \"opens\": \"00:00\",\n                        \"closes\": \"23:59\"\n                    }\n                ],\n                \"areaServed\": [\n                    \"Dubai\",\n                    \"Abu Dhabi\",\n                    \"Sharjah\",\n                    \"Ajman\",\n                    \"Ras Al Khaimah\",\n                    \"Fujairah\",\n                    \"Umm Al Quwain\",\n                    \"Oman\"\n                ],\n                \"sameAs\": [\n                    \"https://wa.me/971569213754\"\n                ]\n            },\n            \"areaServed\": [\n                \"Dubai\",\n                \"Abu Dhabi\",\n                \"Sharjah\",\n                \"Ajman\",\n                \"Ras Al Khaimah\",\n                \"Fujairah\",\n                \"Umm Al Quwain\",\n                \"Oman\"\n            ],\n            \"offers\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n                \"priceCurrency\": \"AED\",\n                \"price\": \"1000\",\n                \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n                \"validFrom\": \"2026-01-01\"\n            }\n        },\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n            \"@id\": \"https://generatordubai.com/service/portacabin#breadcrumb\",\n            \"itemListElement\": [\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n                    \"position\": 1,\n                    \"name\": \"Home\",\n                    \"item\": \"https://generatordubai.com\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n                    \"position\": 2,\n                    \"name\": \"Services\",\n                    \"item\": \"https://generatordubai.com/services\"\n                },\n                {\n                    \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\n                    \"position\": 3,\n                    \"name\": \"Portacabin & Site Offices\",\n                    \"item\": \"https://generatordubai.com/service/portacabin\"\n                }\n            ]\n        }\n    ]\n}'),(21,'Turnkey Site Electrical & Distribution Packages','we-offer','Temporary Power Distribution UAE | Cables, ATS Panels & External Fuel Tanks','Turnkey Electrical Packages • ATS Panels • Rubber Cables • Bunded Tanks','layers','Complete site power electrical distribution rental across Dubai and UAE. Featuring 100A to 4000A Automatic Transfer Switches (ATS), flexible H07RN-F rubber power cables, IP65 distribution boards, step-up transformers, and bunded fuel tanks.','<div class=\"space-y-8\">\n    <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-normal\">\n        A generator is only as effective as the distribution network that carries power to your site machinery. At <strong>Generator Dubai</strong>, we supply complete <strong>turnkey site electrical and temporary power distribution packages across the UAE</strong>. From heavy-duty Automatic Transfer Switch (ATS) panels and motorized synchronizing switchboards to flexible H07RN-F rubber power cabling, weather-resistant distribution boards (DBs), step-up/step-down transformers, and double-walled external bulk diesel tanks, we provide everything needed for a safe, code-compliant temporary electrical installation.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-8\">\n        <div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/60 border border-amber-200/80 space-y-3\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-800 font-bold text-sm\">\n                <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-amber-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\"/></svg>\n                <span>Automated ATS Changeover Panels (100A to 4000A)</span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">\n                Equipped with motorized ABB or Schneider 4-pole circuit breakers and intelligent microprocessors, our ATS panels detect utility mains brownouts or blackouts and start the generator automatically, transferring the load in under 10 seconds with zero operator intervention.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 space-y-3\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-900 font-bold text-sm\">\n                <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg>\n                <span>Heavy-Duty H07RN-F Flexible Rubber Cables</span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed\">\n                Ordinary PVC cables crack under intense UAE sun and vehicular site traffic. We provide premium EPR/PCP rubber insulated H07RN-F power cables (35mm² to 300mm²) with compression lugs, cam-lock plugs, and heavy-duty polyurethane drive-over cable ramps.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 font-display pt-4\">Site Power Distribution Equipment Matrix</h2>\n    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 my-6 shadow-sm\">\n        <table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n            <thead class=\"bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold uppercase text-[11px] tracking-wider\">\n                <tr>\n                    <th class=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Equipment Category</th>\n                    <th class=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Available Capacities / Sizes</th>\n                    <th class=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Key Safety Features</th>\n                    <th class=\"py-3.5 px-4\">Typical Application</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100 bg-white\">\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition\">\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900\">Automatic Transfer Switches (ATS)</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">100A, 250A, 400A, 800A, 1600A, 2500A, 4000A</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">4-Pole motorized interlocked breakers, phase monitoring, manual bypass handle</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Hospitals, commercial buildings, data center utility backup</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition\">\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900\">Flexible Power Cabling</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Single Core &amp; 4-Core (35mm² to 300mm²)</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Oil &amp; UV resistant H07RN-F rubber, Class 5 flexible stranded copper, crimped lugs</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Connecting generators to main distribution boards &amp; chillers</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition\">\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900\">Site Distribution Boards (MDB / SDB)</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">63A to 1250A Weatherproof IP65 Panels</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Integrated RCD/ELCB 30mA earth leakage protection, MCBs, 16A/32A CEE sockets</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Construction site power, tower cranes, outdoor events</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition\">\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900\">External Bunded Fuel Storage</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">1,000L, 2,500L, 5,000L, 10,000L Tanks</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Double-walled 110% containment bund, automatic transfer pump, remote fuel telemetry</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Long-term continuous prime power, 7-day unattended runtime</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50 transition\">\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900\">Step-Up / Step-Down Transformers</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">500 kVA to 5000 kVA (415V to 11kV / 22kV / 33kV)</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Oil-immersed or dry-type, Buchholz relay, high-voltage switchgear</td>\n                    <td class=\"py-3 px-4 text-slate-600\">Long-distance desert transmission, utility substation injection</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 font-display pt-4\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n    <div class=\"space-y-4 my-6\">\n        <details class=\"group rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 p-5 transition-all\">\n            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer list-none\">\n                <span>Can you supply cable ramps for high-traffic site roads?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">▼</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                Yes. We provide heavy-duty polyurethane 2-channel, 3-channel, and 5-channel drive-over cable protectors rated up to 40 tons per axle, ensuring safety for dump trucks, concrete mixers, and site vehicles.\n            </div>\n        </details>\n        <details class=\"group rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 p-5 transition-all\">\n            <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between font-bold text-sm text-slate-900 cursor-pointer list-none\">\n                <span>Do your distribution boards comply with DEWA site safety regulations?</span>\n                <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-bold group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">▼</span>\n            </summary>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-200/60 pt-3\">\n                Yes. All temporary distribution boards feature 4-pole isolating main breakers, 30mA residual current devices (RCD) on all socket outlets, copper earthing bars, and certified IP65 weatherproof powder-coated steel or rubber enclosures.\n            </div>\n        </details>\n    </div>\n</div>','[\"Automatic Transfer Switches (ATS): 100A to 4000A with motorized 4-pole ABB/Schneider breakers\", \"Flexible Rubber Cables: Premium H07RN-F (35mm² to 300mm²) with certified copper lugs & cam-locks\", \"Weatherproof Distribution Boards (IP65): Integrated RCD/ELCB protection & CEE industrial sockets\", \"External Bunded Fuel Storage Tanks: 1,000L to 10,000L double-walled containment with auto-pumps\", \"High-Voltage Step-Up Transformers: 415V to 11kV / 22kV / 33kV for long-distance transmission\", \"Certified DEWA & ADDC Electrical Cable Termination, Earthing Rod Installation & Site Safety Audits\"]','[\"Complete Single-Source Solution: No need to hire cables from one vendor and ATS from another\", \"Maximum Site Safety: Oil-resistant cables, vehicular cable ramps, and sensitive 30mA shock protection\", \"Extended Unattended Runtime: Bunded fuel tanks allow up to 7 to 14 days of continuous operation\", \"Instant On-Site Mobilization: Delivered and connected simultaneously with your rental generator\"]',NULL,'media/2026/10/blog/ats-switch-guide.jpg','published',6,1,'temporary power distribution equipment uae','Temporary Power Distribution UAE | Cables, ATS & Fuel Tanks','Complete site power accessories: ATS panels, synchronising switchgear, armored rubber cables, and external bunded fuel storage across Dubai & UAE.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://generatordubai.com/storage/media/2026/10/04-be9wys.jpg',1,95,90,'2026-10-13 22:37:45','2026-10-14 22:09:41','{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@graph\": [\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"Service\",\n            \"@id\": \"https://generatordubai.com/service/we-offer#service\",\n            \"name\": \"Turnkey Site Electrical & Distribution Packages\",\n            \"serviceType\": \"Diesel Power Engineering & Rental\",\n            \"description\": \"Complete site power accessories: ATS panels, synchronising switchgear, armored cables, and external fuel storage across Dubai & UAE.\",\n            \"url\": \"https://generatordubai.com/service/we-offer\",\n            \"image\": \"https://generatordubai.com/storage/media/2026/10/04-be9wys.jpg\",\n            \"provider\": {\n                \"@type\": \"HomeAndConstructionBusiness\",\n                \"@id\": \"https://generatordubai.com/#organization\",\n                \"name\": \"Generator Dubai\",\n                \"legalName\": \"Generator Dubai Temporary Power Solutions LLC\",\n                \"alternateName\": [\n                    \"Generator Rental Dubai\",\n                    \"Rental Generator UAE\"\n                ],\n                \"url\": \"https://generatordubai.com\",\n                \"logo\": \"https://generatordubai.com/images/logo-original.png\",\n                \"image\": \"https://generatordubai.com/storage/media/2026/09/1-y7ja6x.webp\",\n                \"telephone\": \"+971569213754\",\n                \"email\": \"hello@generatordubai.com\",\n                \"priceRange\": \"$$$\",\n                \"address\": {\n                    \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n                    \"streetAddress\": \"Suit 44, King Faisal Street\",\n                    \"addressLocality\": \"Sharjah\",\n                    \"addressRegion\": \"Sharjah\",\n                    \"postalCode\": \"00000\",\n                    \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"\n                },\n                \"geo\": {\n                 